## Featured projects

### AI & intelligent systems

#### [CDSS — Explainable Generative Multi-Agent Clinical Decision Support](https://github.com/rezsirine/CDSS)

An agentic system that proposes diagnostic hypotheses from free-text symptoms, with verifiable explanations and a confidence score.

- **Multi-agent pipeline:** symptom extraction, hypothesis generation, clinical validation, explanation, and confidence scoring, coordinated by an asynchronous orchestrator
- **Generation:** BioGPT-Large combined with RAG over PubMed
- **Explainability:** SHAP and counterfactual explanations, plus uncertainty quantification for calibrated confidence
- **Interface:** Streamlit app and a Python API, with an evaluation module (accuracy, F1, calibration)
- **Datasets referenced:** MedQA, PubMedQA, Symptom2Disease

`Python` `LLM` `RAG` `Multi-agent` `XAI` `Streamlit`

#### [AIDev Analysis — Human–AI Collaboration in Code Review](https://github.com/rezsirine/AIDEV)

A data-analysis project studying how human developers and AI agents collaborate in GitHub pull-request review, built on the public [AIDev dataset](https://huggingface.co/datasets/hao-li/AIDev).

- **Reproducible pipeline:** data loading, metric computation, statistical analysis, and visualization as separate scripts
- **Outputs:** a final analysis dataset, figures, and statistical reports
- Academic project, École Nationale des Sciences de l'Informatique (2025/2026)

`Python` `Data analysis` `Statistics` `Visualization`

